The '''Crop Analyzer''' is a machine in the {{Zone|Underground Lab}} that allows players to analyze [[Mutations]] unlocked after completing {{NPCSprite|Beth}}'s quest.

== Overview ==
=== DNA Sequencing ===
Upon analyzing a '''Mutation''', a minigame in which one must sequence its DNA begins, shown by {{Green|4}} colored nodes on both sides of the interface and several connecting strings in the middle. Clicking on a string and then clicking on another one in the same row swaps the positions around. The player must connect each colored node to the other colored node on the opposite side through sequencing the strings properly.

Completing the minigame grants {{Copper}}. Additionally, analyzing a mutation for the first time grants an increased amount of {{Copper}} and grants progress towards Milestones.

