== Trivia ==
* The analysis {{c|alt=Coin}} cost of [[Mutations]] is {{Green|2,000×}} higher than the given {{Copper}}, with the exception of {{ID|Cheesebite}} where the analysis cost is {{Green|1,000×}} higher instead.
* Mass analysing [[Mutations]] grants {{Copper|+1}} more per [[Mutation]] than manual analysis.

